Name: Krypton local speech ABI adapter
URL: https://github.com/moonshine-ai/moonshine
Version: Moonshine 0.1.6; ONNX Runtime 1.32.0
Security Critical: yes
Shipped: yes
License: GPL-3.0 (adapter); MIT (Moonshine and ONNX Runtime)

Source-only integration, not yet built or accepted. The streaming core is
pinned separately from model bytes. Only MIT Tiny/Small streaming models are
eligible. Models are fetched for development hash pinning only under explicit
authorization and are not staged or installed by this build.

The adapter exposes the six existing SODA C exports and runs only in Chromium's
existing speech-recognition utility sandbox. It uses the existing sandbox's
read-only model access without adding a file rule. Browser microphone capture
is mediated by AudioSourceFetcher; websites cannot start this host feature.

No audio or transcript logging, file output, remote providers, telemetry,
automatic model downloads, or model updates are permitted. Resource use and
recognition/endpoint quality are unmeasured.
